Line 2: "and" doesn't join text: it means both, for yes or no values.
    keep greeting as "Hello, " and "Ann".
                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
To join text, use commas in "say" (say "Hello,", name) or "followed by" ("Hello, " followed by name).

Line 3: "and" needs yes or no on both sides, but the right side is a number.
    keep mixed as yes and 5.
                  ^^^^^^^^^

Line 5: "and" doesn't join text: it means both, for yes or no values.
    say "Hello, " and name.
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
To join text, use commas in "say" (say "Hello,", name) or "followed by" ("Hello, " followed by name).

Line 6: "and" doesn't join text: it means both, for yes or no values.
    say name and yes.
        ^^^^^^^^^^^^
To join text, use commas in "say" (say "Hello,", name) or "followed by" ("Hello, " followed by name).
